>
  <KeyTakeaways
    items={[
      'Ulcerative colitis is an inflammatory bowel disease of the colon and rectal lining — bloody diarrhoea, urgency, and mucosal injury driven by a dysregulated local immune response.',
      'Melanocortin signalling through MC1R reduces inflammatory cytokines and increases efferocytosis, the clearing of dead cells that lets tissue return to normal rather than merely go quiet.',
      'PL-8177 is an investigational oral, selective MC1R agonist formulated to release in the colon and act on the lining without being absorbed into the blood.',
